pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: sec-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 32, 44, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      bold: true
      text: "10"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 34, 700, 30]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      text: Grad-CAM × 认知科学：模型"看"哪里
  - elementId: head-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 76, 840, 1.5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  # 三张 Grad-CAM 图
  - elementId: gc-1
    elementType: image
    bounds: [60, 100, 266, 133]
    src: media/meningioma_Te-aug-me_1.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: gc-2
    elementType: image
    bounds: [347, 100, 266, 133]
    src: media/pituitary_Te-pi_1.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: gc-3
    elementType: image
    bounds: [634, 100, 266, 133]
    src: media/glioma_Te-gl_10.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: gc-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 240, 840, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [center, top]
      text: 图 7　三个类别的 Grad-CAM 可视化：左为原始 MRI，右为模型注意力热力图（红 = 关注度高）
  # 两个认知科学观察（含证据边界）
  - elementId: obs-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 278, 840, 82]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent"><strong>观察一：机器注意与人类阅片模式形成类比。</strong></span>三类正确样本的热区都落在影像上的病灶样区域附近，与"放射科医生优先注视病灶"的阅片模式一致。<span style="color:$muted">证据边界：本数据无病灶分割标注、无眼动记录，这是定性类比，尚不能断言人机注意定量重合。</span></p>
  - elementId: obs-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 368, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#D8CFC0"}
  - elementId: obs-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 382, 840, 82]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent"><strong>观察二：错误也呈现"认知性"结构。</strong></span>在若干误判样本上，热区仍覆盖异常区域——提示瓶颈可能在特征鉴别而非区域定位，类似初学者能定位病灶却分不清亚型；作为定性线索，它与混淆矩阵的错误结构相互印证。</p>
  - elementId: obs-conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 470, 840, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13.5
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: MiSans
      bold: true
      text: 热力图把"黑箱分类器"变成可与人比较的认知对象；下一步用眼动实验做注视点—热区重叠率的定量验证。
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 512, 400, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      text: 脑肿瘤 MRI 图像分类辅助诊断系统 · 认知科学大作业
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 512, 40, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 9
      align: [right, top]
      text: "11"
